// Two-line exchanges for patrol officers. The first line is the player's, the second the character's; each knot is one exchange.

=== greeting ===
Evening, officer. # who:player
Evening. Keep your hands where I can see them. Joking. Mostly.
-> END

=== smalltalk ===
Quiet night? # who:player
Quiet is a word nobody says out loud on this job.
-> END

=== busy ===
Do you have a moment? # who:player
Not right now. Dispatch is talking in my ear.
-> END

=== deflect ===
What is happening over there? # who:player
Official business. Please keep moving.
-> END

=== farewell ===
Stay safe, officer. # who:player
Stay legal, citizen.
-> END
